| !Resizer: freeglut's resizer: a window (and a second one) that you can move,
| resize, hide and show from the keyboard; the keys are listed in Output.
| Built unchanged from freeglut 3.8.0 (progs/demos) against riscos-mesa's
| freeglut, whose RISC OS back end uses Wimp windows, Wimp menus and native
| EGL. Text output goes to the file Output in this application.
Set Resizer$Dir <Obey$Dir>
Set Resizer$Output /|<Resizer$Dir>/Output
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error !Resizer needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0.00 RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0.00 Error !Resizer needs ARMEABISupport
Run <Resizer$Dir>.!RunImage
